WEBVTT

00:04:27.972 --> 00:04:31.309
But from my experience,
no one knows how far it could go.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.601
It's fairly simple.

00:04:32.643 --> 00:04:36.689
Technology usually grows exponentially,
and so will our virtual presence.

00:04:37.606 --> 00:04:39.525
And someone has to dress these people.

00:04:39.859 --> 00:04:40.985
Thank you.